    "show_share": true,
    "description": "November was a month of high achievement and significant momentum for the Aga Khan University's Arusha Climate and Environmental Research Centre (AKU-ACER). The Centre strengthened its global partnerships, secured major new funding, and deepened its influence on crucial policy discussions across Africa.",
